{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Seer has her eyes set on two new heroes to battle the looming evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash devastating new combos and redefine your strategy with two powerful adventurers ready to be drafted. Wield the raw power of fire and the mind-bending force of time as you discover fresh team synergies and snowball like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Candlemage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outcast from Candlekeep over a misunderstanding with a wet blanket, the Candlemage now roams the world trying to find a way to redeem himself. This mainly entails burning everything that moves into ashes.\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654160/extras/Candle_Mage_Action_Shot.gif?t=1745515353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Good Knight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield the mighty power of the Day-Night cycle. Revel in the power of nightfall and soothe your team in the healing soft light of dawn. The Good Knight holds his ancient Sword of the Cosmos high in the face of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654160/extras/Good_Knight_Action_Shot.gif?t=1745515353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654160?t=1745515353","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654160?t=1745515353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654160/d490ab07ee8497f7ffa98995dc45c6bf7de55231/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745515353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654160/d490ab07ee8497f7ffa98995dc45c6bf7de55231/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745515353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio